cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these benchmark data or results, please cite them as below. The study llm-pentest-juice-shop-2026 was run and operated by the Darkmoon team (ASC-IT) and is not an independent benchmark."
type: dataset
title: "Darkmoon-Benchmarks: open benchmark data for autonomous AI penetration testing"
authors:
  - name: "Darkmoon team (ASC-IT)"
    website: "https://dark-moon.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ASCIT31/Darkmoon-Benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/ASCIT31/Darkmoon-Benchmarks"
date-released: 2026-10-25
license: GPL-3.0
keywords:
  - penetration testing
  - large language models
  - benchmark
  - OWASP Juice Shop
  - AI security
abstract: >-
  Benchmark records of autonomous AI penetration testing. The study llm-pentest-juice-shop-2026
  publishes a minimised dataset of 21 runs of 16 tool x LLM configurations against OWASP Juice Shop
  (July to October 2026, BenchmarkAI platform), with recomputed difficulty-weighted scores, validation
  scripts and a full statement of limitations. Datasets are licensed CC BY 4.0, code GPL-3.0.
